<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has intensified cross-border operations, striking a Hezbollah weapons shipment in Lebanon's eastern Beqaa Valley and demolishing a Hezbollah tunnel in southern Lebanon, while an Israeli drone was filmed flying low over homes in southern Lebanon. US envoy Waltz visited Beirut to demand Hezbollah disarmament, and Israel claimed to have kidnapped Iranian generals in a bid to locate Ron Arad. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQV21RWWVYdWFod01WNnMycV9tb1RhLUNPVTRQZERqRDRYaXhuLVpVYTJxZWlObmpDWVRxQk5zVVhHTjZ5VXFtSjVHb1lqek1XUEFQS0FmYWxSYXp6YzdORTRnQmgyak11MkxuOU9acGwtY0pKX2ROZzBQdmxoTVZtZkFEWUpKb3kzZ0NZRGYwUlJTQWFIRUpaSTVVTVlrRHRzMVZfMVJyakgyd0lHeGVUd2RYcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNazVnNWlWVGxlSDV3VGl6QUdCamNPZWhZeHVLVFBjLU1PTUhTYXpzSkdGekh4b3ZneXVwMGNjQk5oNkcwZFhjMDVWNXBPUlVUVHBzSnc3cHBaUHkwR1pkVUV2U25ucUdOTzB5bG4wOUtsSDl6c3B1dWpXVl9rV0tsRzFsdVlRMEpvRW1N?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOb0xIQUpsVXpkajhmRWZYNGVQSWRORDZjVm1UcDU0dTFteVh1b09JWTNjcVRuUTRFVDhaZF9FUElKRkNGa2MwQ2c1OF9ISGJVMDc0UWIwNjhLTkRFLWswM1d6YUxYLXFPVzU0VnZTZ1hBc29JNVRJXzlTSUZmenk3NDNuRkpLc2N6TkJkY3BYSi14Z0h4SFBlcG10YXRaY2RQYWpQTEFvU3dUY3NyUUtEMlhXZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articl